o print version and exit 0, matching the\n          pattern used in cmd/echo and other utilities in this project.\n      - id: D4\n        text: |\n          Read entire file content into memory before reversing. tac requires\n          backward traversal of the input, so streaming is not feasible. Use\n          os.ReadAll for stdin and os.ReadFile for file arguments.\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: cmd/tac/main.go compiles with no errors or lint warnings under golangci-lint.\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"tac with no arguments reads stdin and prints lines in reverse order.\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: \"tac with file arguments concatenates files and prints all lines in reverse.\"\n      - id: AC4\n        text: \"tac -s SEP splits on the given separator string and reverses records.\"\n      - id: AC5\n        text: \"tac -b attaches the separator before each record instead of after.\"\n      - id: AC6\n        text: \"tac -r treats the separator as a regular expression.\"\n      - id: AC7\n        text: \"go test ./cmd/tac/ passes with gtac as the reference binary.\"\n      - id: AC8\n        text: \"Tests skip gracefully with t.Skip when gtac is not in PATH.\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"00db2a95-accc-41d3-9843-a9c03f94a098","total_cost_usd":0.23432875,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":27551,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":2485,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":27551,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":2485,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":27551,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.23432875,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"aff1513b-2a97-421b-aef2-c621076509c2"}
